### ==============================================================================
### ShopCraft API - Day 07: OAuth2 Social Login & JWT Bridge HTTP Verification
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Initiate GitHub OAuth2 Authorization Flow (Redirects to GitHub Consent Screen)
GET http://localhost:8080/oauth2/authorization/github

### 2. Verify OAuth2 Callback Endpoint with Minted Tokens
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/oauth2/callback?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.test&refreshToken=test-rt-uuid

### 3. Verify Accessing Protected User Profile with OAuth2 Bearer Token
@sampleToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.dummy
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{sampleToken}}
